      "content": "It makes sense to feel like you are \"performing\" life when your emotional self feels disconnected from your daily routine, but please know that you are still a whole person, just in a fragile and quiet place. The \"me\" you are trying to find is not a static hobby list but a living presence that can feel hollow while it is actually healing from a massive loss. It is okay to take a rest from the \"performance\" and explore just the bare quiet of being you, without the weight of a life you hope to finish living.",
